## Truth Incident #4 Record
The price-snapshot.json (commit 0cbd566) contained 10 fabricated prices populated
from model memory instead of live API data. Architect-verified: only 3/13 non-Anthropic
entries matched the live Pricing API. Root cause: pricing.ts queried by raw model ID
(not display name), API returned zero matches for all, bare catch swallowed the error,
everything fell back to the snapshot, and the snapshot was filled from memory.

This redo: snapshot reverted to sonnet-4-6 only (the one model genuinely absent from
the API). Pricing.ts rewritten with display-name map + hard-failure semantics.

